rge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fovea\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_perf/fovea-icon.png\" alt=\"Fovea\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sightline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_perf/sightline-icon.png\" alt=\"Sightline\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/swiftgen\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_perf/swiftgen-icon.png\" alt=\"Swiftgen\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/streamline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/_perf/streamline-icon.png\" alt=\"Streamline\" width=\"84\" height=\"84\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/interframe/interframe-hrel.png\" alt=\"相关项目\" width=\"338\" height=\"46\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fsodium\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/interframe/rel/interframe-rel-sodium.png\" alt=\"Sodium\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252firis\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/interframe/rel/interframe-rel-iris.png\" alt=\"Iris Shaders\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252freeses-sodium-options\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://bigbro-itzamekyros.duckdns.org/mods/interframe/rel/interframe-rel-reeses.png\" alt=\"Reese&#x27;s Sodium Options\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p><em>需要 NeoForge 1.21.1 和 JDK 21。采用 MIT 许可证。允许在整合包中免费使用。</em></p>",
